  "bodyHash": "ce6890a8b9f338d4",
  "content": "\n\n<p>Rechiseled: AE2 新增了與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a> 及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rechiseled\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rechiseled</a> 的整合功能。\n此整合為 AE2 的方塊引入了超過 60 種新變體。</p>\n<p>鈦石英：\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/825/679/2024-02-18_17.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>天石：\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/825/680/2024-02-18_17.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>方塊：\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/825/682/2024-03-15_15.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>本模組提供的所有紋理均基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rechiseled\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rechiseled</a> 的原始石英與石頭紋理，由 <a href=\"https://github.com/SuperMartijn642\" rel=\"nofollow\">SuperMartijn642</a> 製作。\n此模組需同時安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rechiseled\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rechiseled</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a> 方可使用。</p>",
